- Resolved merge conflicts when merging A/physics-input-test into A/feature/save-load and then into A/feature/level-editor.
- Fixed EventBus sentinel bug in PlayingState by changing the sentinel to static_cast<size_t>(-1).
- Swapped letter-based debug key triggers to non-conflicting Num1-Num9 keys.
- Replaced hardcoded level times and toast positions with Constants constants.
- Encapsulated keyBindings getter by returning a copy and providing a narrow getKeyBinding accessor in Game.
- Cleared achievements activeToasts queue in setUnlockedAchievements to prevent rendering stale toasts on load.
- Aligned achievement IDs in trigger points and lists with SPEC.md schemas ("100_coins" / "beat_bowser").
- Added explicit <ctime> include and used std::gmtime in Serializer.cpp to properly format UTC timestamps.
- Added player direct friend access for Serializer to restore stats without triggering gameplay events.
- Derived completed level maps dynamically from levelId inside saveGame.
- Switched float comparisons in verify_save_load.cpp to epsilon checks.
- Fixed out-of-bounds coordinates risk in saveLevel by clamping spawnPoint and flagpole coordinates to map boundaries.
- Converted absolute local paths in Week 6 progress report links to repository-relative links and rebuilt the report PDF.
- Verified that both verify_save_load and verify_map_editor tests compile and pass successfully.
